{"sections":[{"type":"Meta","title":"Which skills are employers seeking in your area?","description":"Select a UK local authority to explore local trends in online job adverts ","contentTitle":"Title for google analytics","releaseDate":"2023-01-01","lastUpdated":"2023-01-01","outputSeries":"slugforoutputseries","contentType":"robo-journalism"},{"type":"Twisty","title":"These are \"statistics in development\". Learn more here.","content":"<p>This article presents “official statistics in development”. This means they are subject to revision, and may change in the future following user feedback.</p><p>Further information is included in the <a href=\"https://www.ons.gov.uk/employmentandlabourmarket/peopleinwork/employmentandemployeetypes/methodologies/measuringlabourdemandvolumesacrosstheukusingtextkerneldatauserguide\">accompanying user guide.</a></p>"},{"type":"Header","title":"Job adverts in North Ayrshire","label":"Select a UK local authority to explore local trends in online job adverts. All London local authorities are combined. "},{"type":"Summary","title":"In North Ayrshire:","sections":[{"indicator":"Job adverts","value":"1.3","note":"","content":"<p>In August 2024, the number of live job adverts in North Ayrshire was below the UK average. </p><p><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><a href=\"#job_adverts\">More about job adverts</a>  &darr;</span></p>"},{"indicator":"Skills","value":"47%","note":"","content":"<p>In Highlands and Islands, a lower proportion of adverts in 2023 could have been filled by local people. </p><p><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><a href=\"#skills\">More about skills</a>  &darr;</span></p>"},{"indicator":"Health","value":"38%","note":"","content":"<p>A lower proportion of health and social care job adverts in Highlands and Islands could have been filled by local people. </p><p><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><a href=\"#health\">More about health and social care job adverts</a>  &darr;</span></p>"}]},{"id":"job_adverts","type":"Section","title":"In August 2024, there were fewer online job adverts than the UK average in North Ayrshire","content":"<p>In August 2024, the number of live job adverts in North Ayrshire remained around 1.2 per 100 working-age residents (aged 16 to 64 years). </p><p>This was lower than the UK average of 3.4 adverts per 100 working-age residents in August 2024. </p>"},{"id":"linechart","type":"Chart","chartType":"line","title":"Trends in job adverts","subtitle":"Trends in job adverts per 100 working-age residents in North Ayrshire, June 2017 to August 2024","footer":"Source: Textkernel, Office for National Statistics","data":[{"z":"North Ayrshire","x":"2017-05-31T23:00:00.000Z","y":0.639887735},{"z":"North Ayrshire","x":"2017-06-30T23:00:00.000Z","y":0.681267541},{"z":"North Ayrshire","x":"2017-07-31T23:00:00.000Z","y":0.669273395},{"z":"North Ayrshire","x":"2017-08-31T23:00:00.000Z","y":0.639887735},{"z":"North Ayrshire","x":"2017-09-30T23:00:00.000Z","y":0.528941876},{"z":"North Ayrshire","x":"2017-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","y":0.466572313},{"z":"North Ayrshire","x":"2017-12-01T00:00:00.000Z","y":0.444503082},{"z":"North Ayrshire","x":"2018-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","y":0.448343552},{"z":"North Ayrshire","x":"2018-02-01T00:00:00.000Z","y":0.516200955},{"z":"North Ayrshire","x":"2018-03-01T00:00:00.000Z","y":0.515595085},{"z":"North Ayrshire","x":"2018-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","y":0.553037831},{"z":"North Ayrshire","x":"2018-04-30T23:00:00.000Z","y":0.557097157},{"z":"North Ayrshire","x":"2018-05-31T23:00:00.000Z","y":0.586178901},{"z":"North Ayrshire","x":"2018-06-30T23:00:00.000Z","y":0.605869665},{"z":"North Ayrshire","x":"2018-07-31T23:00:00.000Z","y":0.585270097},{"z":"North Ayrshire","x":"2018-08-31T23:00:00.000Z","y":0.640040714},{"z":"North Ayrshire","x":"2018-09-30T23:00:00.000Z","y":0.692206093},{"z":"North Ayrshire","x":"2018-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","y":0.739463927},{"z":"North Ayrshire","x":"2018-12-01T00:00:00.000Z","y":0.614109493},{"z":"North Ayrshire","x":"2019-01-01T00:0